From: Aspartame GTK4 migration
Subject: [PATCH] shell: register Activity state before spawning the client

The GTK4 Casilda client is not an X11 window, so ShellModel cannot discover
it through the GTK window-added callback. Register the launch in Jarabe before
spawning the child; the Activity D-Bus service and child-watch then complete
or remove that model entry through the normal lifecycle path.

---
 src/jarabe/journal/misc.py | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/src/jarabe/journal/misc.py b/src/jarabe/journal/misc.py
--- a/src/jarabe/journal/misc.py
+++ b/src/jarabe/journal/misc.py
@@ -308,6 +308,7 @@ def launch(bundle, activity_id, object_id='', uri='', invited=False,
         color = profile.get_color()
 
+    shell_model.notify_launch(activity_id, bundle.get_bundle_id())
     launcher.add_launcher(activity_id, bundle.get_icon(), color)
     activity_handle = ActivityHandle(activity_id=activity_id,
